cess Ariel is very different  than the other Disney Princesses  mushiya mermaid but she's also a mother  in the Little Mermaid to return to the  sea were introduced to princess melody  she's smart adventurous and somewhat of  a tomboy and she's every bit her  mother's daughter craving the ocean like  a fresh breath of air melody strikes a  deal with the sea witch Morgana  by the end of the movie it's clear that  melody wants to live in Atlantica with  her grandfather so just when we thought  Ariel was going to get a happily ever  after her young daughter jumped ship and  became everything her mother never  wanted to be auntie Ursula just when we  thought that Ariel's family tree  couldn't get any more messed up we've  realized that Disney originally intended  for Ursula to be Ariel's and ultimately  Disney chose against making King Triton  and Ursula brother and sister however  they did leave a major clue in the  original film that could be used to  prove their lineage their possible  brother and sister relationship is  hinted at when Ursula speaks at a time  when she and Triton lived in the same  palace so Ariel's family tree has both  gods and sea witches ingrained into it  you would think that Ursula would have  been a little nicer to her youngest  niece but once a sea witch always a sea  witch great-uncle Zeus and Hades since  Disney chose to put auntie Ursula on the  back burner we're going to focus on King  Triton's mythological roots if you look  at Triton's family tree you quickly find  out that Zeus is his father's brother so  this makes loose none other than Ariel's  great-uncle  but since Ariel's grandfather Poseidon  has three sons in total this also means  that Hades is Ariel's great-uncle as  well  you know I know I got it I got the  concept is it just us or is Ariel's  family tree jam-packed with some of the  most powerful God's of all time  Ariel's cousins now that we know that  Ariel's great uncle's are none other  than Zeus and Hades we can finally  confirm the relation between Hercules  and Ariel  these two main characters are second  cousins despite coming from very  different worlds if we dig a little  deeper we also realize that Princess  Ariel ends now from descendants our  cousins as well after all she is Hades  daughter right who we'd love to see  Ariel Hercules and now getting together  for a royal family reunion but that's  probably not going to happen anytime  soon that is unless mal finds out who  her father is in descendants three and  connects the dots quarter God Princess  Ariel by now we're all well aware that  princess Ariel's lineage dates all the  way back to Greek mythology she's a  daughter of a demigod making her a  quarter God and putting her on the same  spectrum as Maui from Moana while it  makes perfect sense that Ariel can  breathe underwater and communicate with  her fellow mermaids her abilities go  beyond that Ariel's got superhuman  strength durability speed and  adaptability in the bag and she owes  this all to her grandfather Poseidon who  is a full-on God despite only having a  quarter of his powers Ariel is extremely  powerful and she doesn't even know it  she could give her puns ulm awana and  Elsa are run for their money okay well  maybe not Elsa but she's in a league of  her own so there you have it guys the  truth about the little mermaids messed  up family tree were you shocked to find  out that Hercules mal and Ariel were  actually second cousins let us know how  you feel about Ariel's lineage in the  comment section below  and that's a wrap like and subscribe to  the things so you never miss another  video thanks for watching we'll see you  next time  [Music]

